    "caveats": [
      "X4 - L1 conflates three things: (a) the family, (b) XGBoost is not told the three string columns are categorical while LightGBM is (exp_021 D vs D_NOCAT_DIAG sizes that at 1.1e-05 Brier on this exact fold/seed), (c) XGBoost min_child_weight is a hessian sum, so 5000 is a ~20,000-row constraint vs LightGBM's 5000 rows, and X4 also lacks L1's feature_fraction 0.7 / bagging 0.8.  X4H removes (c).",
      "C1 - C4 and C1 - C5 each change exactly one thing and are clean."
